      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُقْ خُقْ</span></b>  [imperative of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَاقَ</span>] <i>Ornament thy
young woman,</i> or <i>female slave, with the earring.</i>
(K. [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَوْقٌ</span>.]) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَاقَهَا</span> <i>He</i> (a man, TA)
<i>made with her</i> (a woman, TA) <i>the sound termed</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاقِ بَاقِ</span> [<i>during the act of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نِكَاح</span>]. (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خاق</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الشَّىْءَ</span> <i>He took away the thing,</i> and <i>extirpated it,</i>
or <i>removed it utterly.</i> (TA.)

